    "body": "> I also considered a new .formElement property which would leave the existing .form property alone and better match existing naming schemes. I don't strongly feel either way on which approach is better.\n\nAdding `.formElement` seems more consistent with the current ARIA reflected element reference, like `aria-labelledby`/`.ariaLabelledByElements`, `aria-activedescendant`/`.ariaActiveDescendantElement`, etc.",
