    "updated_at": "2026-08-27T17:39:10Z",
    "body": "I think not impacting on form.elements and the form name accessors is viable with this API. The main bit is form submission and all the other associated behaviours.\n\nForm associated custom elements can't be submit, or reset buttons, nor can you really build a lot of form controls in a viable way. e.g. For a text input you have to either contend with contenteditable or nest an input anyway.\n\nForm associated custom elements also have one of the same issues in that you can't associate with a form in a parent tree.",
