    "created_at": "2026-08-31T07:26:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-31T07:26:23Z",
    "body": "It doesn't break shadow tree encapsulation, but it does break the way the `form` element works. As a web developer you would no longer be able to reason about a `form` element without also having access to all shadow trees. That seems broken. (I will grant you that the `form` attribute already made this a lot more involved, but still.)",
